---
/**
 * HomeCurriculum.astro - § SECTION 02: 八周教学进程研学周历
 * 宽幅研学条目行，高亮展示当周主讲（第05周）并串联归档讲义库
 */
---

<section class="sec-container not-content">
  <div class="sec-top-header">
    <div>
      <span class="sec-num-prefix">§ SECTION 02</span>
      <h2 class="sec-heading">八周教学进程研学周历</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="sec-abstract">
      前 8 周高强度模块化大课，每次 4 节共 180 分钟，按真实工业化生产流水线依次推进。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="curriculum-list">
    <a href="/lectures/week1/" class="curr-entry-row">
      <span class="week-digit">01</span>
      <div class="curr-headline-wrap">
        <h4>人机协同采编工作台与可署名责任</h4>
        <p>工作区物理隔离与目录工程，Skill 契约与 Python 采访脱敏函数开发</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <span class="status-capsule status-done">已结课 · 归档</span>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-top: var(--space-1);">09.02</div>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="/lectures/week2/" class="curr-entry-row">
      <span class="week-digit">02</span>
      <div class="curr-headline-wrap">
        <h4>原子化知识库解构与智能体编排流水线</h4>
        <p>一手文献三层卡片解构，五要素任务工程拆解，三大核心编排流水线开发</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <span class="status-capsule status-done">已结课 · 归档</span>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-top: var(--space-1);">09.09</div>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="/lectures/week3/" class="curr-entry-row">
      <span class="week-digit">03</span>
      <div class="curr-headline-wrap">
        <h4>账号逆向工程与融媒体产品最小可行原型</h4>
        <p>头部严肃媒体与数字生态解构，视听参数化，MVP 原型开发与验证</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <span class="status-capsule status-done">已结课 · 归档</span>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-top: var(--space-1);">09.15</div>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="/lectures/week4/" class="curr-entry-row">
      <span class="week-digit">04</span>
      <div class="curr-headline-wrap">
        <h4>内容情报雷达与选题发现工程</h4>
        <p>网络化议程设置与信源分级，多源情报抓取清洗，四维价值模型与杀手清单</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <span class="status-capsule status-done">已结课 · 归档</span>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-top: var(--space-1);">09.23</div>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- 本周主讲：高亮点击直达讲义内页 -->
    <a href="/lectures/week5/" class="curr-entry-row highlight-week">
      <span class="week-digit" style="color: var(--accent-primary);">05</span>
      <div class="curr-headline-wrap">
        <h4 style="color: var(--ink-title);">选题决策模型与出版级内容简报工程</h4>
        <p>受众雇佣（JTBD）与数据三角互证，方案比较与 Non-goals 边界，简报三件套工程 (点击进入讲义精读 ➔)</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <span class="status-capsule status-now">本周主讲 · 进行中</span>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--accent-primary); margin-top: var(--space-1); font-weight: 700;">09.30</div>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="/lectures/week6/" class="curr-entry-row">
      <span class="week-digit">06</span>
      <div class="curr-headline-wrap">
        <h4>多模态视听工程与分镜流水线</h4>
        <p>文字简报向视听分镜转化，多模态一致性锁定，跨平台自适应封装流水线</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <span class="status-capsule status-done">讲义就绪 · 待开课</span>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-top: var(--space-1);">10.14</div>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="/lectures/week7/" class="curr-entry-row">
      <span class="week-digit">07</span>
      <div class="curr-headline-wrap">
        <h4>人工审核把关、反馈闭环与审计台账</h4>
        <p>穿透式事实核验，对抗式 Evaluator 智能体，反馈三层解耦与迭代方案</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <span class="status-capsule status-done">讲义就绪 · 待开课</span>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-top: var(--space-1);">10.21</div>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="/lectures/week8/" class="curr-entry-row">
      <span class="week-digit">08</span>
      <div class="curr-headline-wrap">
        <h4>全流程运行、作品集验收与自主可控工作流</h4>
        <p>全链路流水线端到端集成调度，六维表现性量规验收，资产包封装归档</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <span class="status-capsule status-done">讲义就绪 · 待开课</span>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-top: var(--space-1);">10.28</div>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
